-- want_report.md --
govulncheck found 2 vulnerabilities; this PR fixes 2:

**[GO-2021-0113](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2021-0113)**: Out-of-bounds read in golang.org/x/text

    golang.org/x/text v0.3.5 -> v0.3.7

**[GO-2026-5024](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-5024)**: Integer overflow in NewNTUnicodeString in golang.org/x/sys/windows

    golang.org/x/sys v0.20.0 -> v0.44.0
